&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&lt;/strong&gt; (45 mins via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;A conversation with a Hiring Manager focused on your approach to teamwork, client collaboration, and problem-solving in an enterprise engineering team setting. We&#39;ll also share more details about Nearform and the potential projects you may join.&lt;/p&gt;
